  "description": "This YITAMOTOR mirror was engineered to look, fit and function like the original mirror assembly for your vehicle's specific year, make, and model. YITAMOTOR® extendable towing mirrors are engineered to replace the existing 2003-2007 Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra side view mirrors.\nFitment\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado Pickup all models\n2003-2006 GMC Sierra Pickup all models\n2003-2006 Chevy Tahoe\n2003-2006 Chevy Suburban\n2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche\n2003-2006 GMC Yukon / Yukon XL\n2003-2006 Cadillac Escalade all models\n2007 Chevy Silverado Classic Models\n2007 GMC Sierra Classic Models\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nDual Glass Design\nThese towing mirrors are with power-adjusted upper plane glass and manually adjusted the blind-spot convex mirror, providing you a better and wider rear view.\nHeated Upper Plane Glass\nThe upper plane glass of these mirrors is heated for defogging and defrosting. It can defog and defrost by itself, super convenient for you on a rainy or foggy day.\nBuilt-in Arrow Turn Signal Light\nTowing mirrors with turn signals better lets people beside you know your intent to change lanes, reducing the risk of an accident.\nManual Telescoping Function\nThese mirrors can be manually extended about 2.75 inches, so you can have a wider and better rear view. You can also fold them in tight places.\nAluminum Triangle Base\nThese tow mirrors can be stably installed on your vehicle as they adopt classic triangle construction, durable aluminum base, and pre-installed studs.",
